nginx-cf-realip (0.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Verify the peer certificate and hostname on HTTPS fetches
  * Restrict the fetch client to TLS 1.2 and TLS 1.3
  * Size the outbound HTTP request from the URL instead of a fixed buffer
  * Compile the HTTPS client into vendored-header builds

 -- Rumen Damyanov <contact@rumenx.com>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200

nginx-cf-realip (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 1.0.1
  * Automatic Cloudflare IP range synchronization
  * SHA-256 content verification for IP list changes
  * Exponential backoff retry logic for fetch failures
  * Atomic configuration file updates via temporary files
  * HTTPS-only fetching with strict host validation
  * Support for both IPv4 and IPv6 Cloudflare ranges
  * Dynamic module compatible with NGINX 1.18.0+

 -- Rumen Damyanov <contact@rumenx.com>  Mon, 06 Oct 2025 12:00:00 +0000

nginx-cf-realip (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release

